message: "If you use BlenderScratchGPT or Sparse-AST in research, please cite this repository."
title: "BlenderScratchGPT: Sparse-AST Language Models for Blender Code Generation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kanth"
    given-names: "Chaman Prakash"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChamanPrakashKanth/BlenderScratchGPT"
