abstract: >-
  A research and engineering suite for training and evaluating custom Sparse-AST
  language models for Blender Python, procedural geometry, 3D mathematics, and
  code generation, including local inference and mixture-of-experts experiments.
keywords:
  - "Blender AI"
  - "Blender Python"
  - "code generation"
  - "small language model"
  - "mixture of experts"
  - "Sparse-AST"
  - "local LLM"
  - "procedural geometry"
